        "id": 1511268386,
        "content": "Per request from @Hodlatoor we defined the requirements for the menu.\r\n**Top-level menu items:**\r\nTHE DAO \r\nThe Labs\r\nAbout Us\r\n**The behavior**\r\n**THE DAO** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-dao\r\n- On hover - open the dropdown menu:\r\n**The Stable** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-stable\r\n**The Meta** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-meta\r\n**Earn & Stake** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/earn-stake\r\n**The Labs** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-labs\r\n- On hover - open the dropdown menu:\r\n**DevPool** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-devpool\r\n**Github** \r\n- On click - go to https://github.com/ubiquity\r\n**About Us** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/about\r\n- On hover - open the dropdown menu:\r\n**The Mission** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-mission\r\n**The Team** \r\n- On click - go to https://dao.ubq.fi/the-team",
